## 3. Unresolved Leads & Deprioritized Searches

1. **Ultra-Low Biomass Negative Control Standards (SEQC2 / Microbiome Standards):** Several recent preprints propose synthetic spike-in standards for low-biomass air and cleanroom swabs. These were deprioritized because they require adding synthetic DNA pre-extraction, which cannot be retroactively applied to P4's completed 5-expedition field collections.
2. **Global Soil Metatranscriptome Repositories (SoilX):** Multi-biome transcript collections were reviewed, but contain zero representation of hyperarid subtropical sand seas ($<50$ mm rainfall). Retained **León-Sobrino et al. (2024)** as the sole high-quality hyperarid desert temporal metatranscriptome benchmark.

---

